<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 19/20.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 19/20.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania  set on</p>
<p>the following currency fixings for Friday, June 20 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   20.06.97	  19.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5540	    6.5520</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3086	    2.3174</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5138	    4.5320</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5276	    3.5202</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5160	    0.5194</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7713	    0.7759</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2886	    0.2897</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0108	    7.0157</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6944	    0.6943</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2322	    1.2354</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
